  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DK support to CISU - Civil Society Activities in the area of Climate and Environment, contribution 2014-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the appropriation is to bring momentum and relevance into negotiation processes on climate and environment by engaging and involving the civil society in developing countries. In order to secure a transparent, lean and professional process an agreement was reached in 2013 with &quot;Civil Society in Development - CISU&quot; to administer a Climate and Environment Fund (CEF) where Danish civil society organisations can apply for Funding to activities in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
